   "fit": {
    "estimated": false,
    "lines": [
     "Context. The nightly export has failed four times this month",
     "because the old queue drops jobs larger than 64 MB. The",
     "new queue streams in chunks, keeps a dead-letter topic,",
     "and already runs the invoice pipeline without incident since",
     "July. Moving the export costs about two days of work and",
     "removes the manual re-run that on-call does every Monday."
